# The castle defend teleporter (CastleDefendTeleporter): the leader of a clan registered to attack
# Gludio Castle's siege is on neither the owner nor the defender side, so Gludio Castle's first
# inner gatekeeper answers its refusal (onFirstTalk), which carries no link: the "1" link of the
# defenders' page, sent anyway, is dropped before the script sees it, and nobody moves.
trace internal/gameserver/script/testdata/oracle/scenarios/castle_defend_teleporter_attacker.golden
character Raider 20
clan 5
siege 1 attacker
script script.teleport.CastleDefendTeleporter
page script/teleport/CastleDefendTeleporter/
npc gatekeeper 35092 Folk 10 0 0

action gatekeeper
action gatekeeper
  S ActionFailed
  S NpcHtmlMessage obj=gatekeeper item=0 page=script/teleport/CastleDefendTeleporter/first_group_1_no.htm
  S ActionFailed
bypass Quest CastleDefendTeleporter 1
